cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite this deposit."
title: "Biomarker analysis and kinetic simulations for a CRISPR/Cas13a-CHA sepsis biosensing system"
abstract: >-
  Code, inputs and results reproducing the computational analyses of the
  CRISPR/Cas13a-CHA sepsis biosensor: selection of the hsa-miR-150-5p /
  hsa-miR-486-5p biomarker pair from GEO series GSE134358 with leak-free
  cross-validation, and the kinetic models of the catalytic hairpin assembly
  circuit.
type: software
version: 1.0.2
date-released: 2026-10-07
license: MIT
keywords:
  - sepsis
  - microRNA
  - CRISPR-Cas13a
  - catalytic hairpin assembly
  - biomarker selection
  - reproducibility
